<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Password Reset Code</title>
    <style>
        body {
            background: #181818;
            color: #E0E0E0;
            font-family: 'SF Pro Display', 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        .card {
            background: #101010;
            max-width: 420px;
            margin: 40px auto;
            border-radius: 18px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 32px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.18);
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #232323;
            padding: 0 0 32px 0;
        }

        .brand {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 32px 0 0 0;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #4CD964;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
            display: block;
        }

        .divider {
            width: 60px;
            height: 3px;
            background: #4CD964;
            margin: 24px auto 24px auto;
            border-radius: 2px;
        }

        .content {
            padding: 0 32px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .content h2 {
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin: 0 0 12px 0;
        }

        .content p {
            color: #E0E0E0;
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin: 0 0 18px 0;
            line-height: 1.7;
        }

        .reset-code {
            background: #232323;
            color: #4CD964;
            font-size: 2.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 8px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 8px;
            padding: 18px 0;
            margin: 24px 0 24px 0;
            border: 1px dashed #4CD964;
            user-select: all;
        }

        .footer {
            background: #181818;
            color: #888;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            padding: 24px 18px 18px 18px;
            border-top: 1px solid #232323;
            margin-top: 32px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 500px) {
            .card {
                margin: 0;
                border-radius: 0;
            }

            .content {
                padding: 0 6vw;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="card">
        <div class="brand">
            <span class="brand-logo">Nomadly</span>
        </div>
        <div class="divider"></div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2>Password Reset Request</h2>
            <p>Hello {{ firstName }},</p>
            <p>We received a request to reset your Nomadly account password. Use the code below to proceed. This code is
                valid for 15 minutes.</p>
            <div class="reset-code">{{ code }}</div>
            <p>If you did not request a password reset, you can safely ignore this email.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            &copy; 2025 Nomadly. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>